### What's New in v1.0.5
- **Rebranded to HackyTube:** Updated application name, window title, shortcuts, and installer to **HackyTube** (`powered by hackymax.fun`).
- **New App Icon:** Added the new **HackyTube Ads Free** logo across the desktop app and installer.
- **Built-in Ad-Blocking:** 0-second player ad stripping, network ad blocking, 100ms auto-skip fallback,integration.
- **Navigation & PiP:** Theme-matched top-left Back button (`chevron-circle-left`), Picture-in-Picture (`Ctrl + Shift + P`) with auto-minimize/restore, and auto-updater support.
